 5. + This 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 The trailer for what's being billed as the first fully AI film just dropped .

 The creators behind "Gods Don't Give Gifts" are submitting the film for a best animated feature Oscar. In a very meta way, the movie touches on the questions that drive much of the conversation and controversy surrounding AI. 
 
